<title>USA: Quantech Ltd registration effective.</title>
<headline>Quantech Ltd registration effective.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quantech Ltd said Friday a registration statement covering the possible sale of 49,021,530 shares by selling shareholders was declared effective by the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>A prospectus was mailed to investors holding these shares, the company said.</p>
<p>Quantech is a development-stage company working to commercialize technology for the medical diagnostic market that could assess whether a patient has suffered a heart attack. The system is being designed for hospital critical care units to provide rapid, quantitative results using whole blood.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
